<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE SECOND STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE SECOND STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LE PUY, France 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>Tuesday's second stage of the Dauphine Libere cycle race over</p>
<p>216 kms from Champagne-au-Mont-d'Or:</p>
<p>1. Vyacheslav Yekimov (Russia) US Postal  6 hours 13 minutes 22</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Pascal Chanteur (France) Casino</p>
<p>3. Richard Virenque (France) Festina</p>
<p>4. Laurent Dufaux (Switzerland) Festina</p>
<p>5. Laurent Brochard (France) Festina</p>
<p>6. Abraham Olano (Spain) Banesto</p>
<p>7. Fabrice Gougot (France) Casino</p>
<p>8. Davide Rebellin (Italy) Francaise des Jeux</p>
<p>9. Michael Boogerd (Netherlands) Rabobank</p>
<p>10. Prudencio Indurain (Spain) Banesto  all same time as the</p>
<p>winner</p>
<p>Overall:</p>
<p> 1. Yekimov	10 hours 35 minutes 2 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Alex Zuelle (Switzerland) ONCE  10 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Olano					     13</p>
<p> 4. Brochard					  15</p>
<p> 5. Boogerd					   18</p>
<p> 6. Christophe Moreau (France) Festina	19</p>
<p> 7. Roland Meier (Switzerland) US Postal    20</p>
<p> 8. Peter Meinert (Denmark) US Postal	 22</p>
<p> 9. Chanteur					  24</p>
<p>10. Dariusz Baranowski (Poland) US Postal  25</p>
</text>
